<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Arnotts yr pretax profit up 25 pct.</title>
<headline>Arnotts yr pretax profit up 25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to January 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		29.5		   vs 20.7</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 7.25		   vs 6.25</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 11.0		   vs 9.5</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    6.80		   vs 5.42</p>
<p> Turnover		   68.99		  vs 66.63</p>
<p>NOTE - Arnotts Plc is an Irish retailing group.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
